# Dockerfile.worker build context. Render builds from a git checkout of
# `main` for this service — separate branches (e.g. ops/db-backup, which
# has its own Dockerfile.backup and no .dockerignore of its own) are
# entirely separate checkouts and unaffected by this file.
#
# Do NOT exclude public/, src/, scripts/, tsconfig.json, next.config.*, or
# drizzle.config.* — the worker renders PDFs by reading fonts/templates off
# disk under public/ (see Dockerfile.worker) and runs TypeScript straight
# out of src/ and scripts/ via tsx, no build step.

.git
node_modules
.next
research/
drizzle/
coverage
*.log
.env*

# Editor / OS junk
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
